Subject: [PATCH 01/54] style: Add common login dialog button styles to avoid
 duplication

This will be used in next commits, when new login buttons are added.

Also, add a missing insensitive_button_bg_color on lockscren buttons,
without it the button was being dark when insensitive.
---
 data/theme/gnome-shell-sass/_common.scss         | 11 +++++++++++
 data/theme/gnome-shell-sass/_drawing.scss        |  1 +
 .../gnome-shell-sass/widgets/_login-lock.scss    | 16 ++--------------
