 showing it

To support the new fade-in flow, the _entryArea is now hidden by default.
The clear() function has been updated to reset this state to hidden.

In _onVerificationFailed(), the call to clear() was removed to prevent the
area from being hidden prematurely. This is safe because a reset() (which
calls clear()) is triggered later in the process.

